{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_024_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:82cdf61b8e2bf68657cd5822477fdeca568559c2d6d6db12975f4ea1b1f4c0b7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6903fc720dce3f035864ae78cabbd584b180f4a1c4d1a8f1df51c5e1d3110b",
      "text": "活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d47a279c8e46dce108ca22df1e815b00cb7483bd00952b38ec657c245874cca3",
      "text": "这里就是今天的活动场地了。\n……四季先生，看起来很高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47c4c1d945bdc574392eade4d266d67aae73e981f3aa580939f0cb658586c3c8",
      "text": "真的很让人怀念啊。不管是摊位还是舞台……\n哇——！好激动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4df0c217ff7214628711d2c27664474f9735c5c0767718a845691a398ac92dd",
      "text": "……没想到我居然也会有站在这个舞台上的一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbbeef890974115b3aa27463b939227a097b2f297c7241f56c4d1ffc50487b3a",
      "text": "我初中时因为各种原因没能加入社团……\n都是一个人听着新歌去唱卡拉OK呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f9930a45249186554764ea96c787092e12088398da4c8b944a47d32585cce8",
      "text": "那个时候我也来过这个活动哦。\n现场听到喜欢乐队的演出超兴奋的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef46f8e6a346f3ee1468c1f773fe833c0e42592cc18b2b14e19c876a23755fda",
      "text": "所以总觉得很自豪！\n真想告诉那个时候的自己啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e680779bf0882656d7136a607bc8b8875a663abd5b919a8071d0069eb3819b3",
      "text": "今天的迷你Live和脱口秀，我会加油的！\n请一直注视着我哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a10a30b01185a4fb88de8048b826ead330a4eefa668efe763867de2301e84b47",
      "text": "好的，当然了。\n我会为你加油的，四季先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a03382f46efdfd48ff23df9ba50e6a1a5ce2f0e38e5f44e0a070a6571dd0cc7",
      "text": "好久不见啦，四季酱。\n过得还好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:754f2b79d8fc38d87835ca9a2ee5e562f47346fcdd2d4612f1c26789699362d1",
      "text": "啊……奶奶！\n你来看我了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
